1. Definitions

“Work” means the project identified above, including its source code, compiled
binaries, JAR files, resource files, data files, configuration examples,
documentation, and other files distributed in its repository or release
packages, unless otherwise specified.

“Modified Version” means any version of the Work that has been changed,
adapted, translated, merged, ported, extended, refactored, or otherwise
derived from the Work, in whole or in part.

“Distribution” means any act of providing the Work or a Modified Version to any
third party, including but not limited to publishing, uploading, sharing,
reposting, sublicensing, bundling, embedding, or making it available for
download or use over a network.

“Commercial Use” means any use primarily intended for or directed toward
commercial advantage, monetary compensation, revenue generation, donation-driven
privileged access, paid services, or other business-related benefit, whether
direct or indirect.

Commercial Use includes, but is not limited to:
(a) selling the Work or any Modified Version;
(b) including the Work or any Modified Version in any paid product, paid
    service, paid modpack, paid launcher, paid distribution, or paid hosting;
(c) using the Work or any Modified Version as part of a commercial Minecraft
    server, server network, hosting platform, monetized game service, or any
    other commercial software or service;
(d) providing the Work or any Modified Version as a donor/VIP/premium feature,
    perk, reward, bundled benefit, or paid add-on;
(e) redistributing the Work or any Modified Version on websites, platforms,
    launchers, marketplaces, or content services that generate revenue from
    access, subscriptions, advertising, traffic monetization, or commercial
    promotion;
(f) selling support, customization, integration, private builds, or derivative
    packages based substantially on the Work without prior written permission
    from the copyright holder.

2. Grant of Permission

Subject to the terms of this License, permission is granted to any person to:

(a) use the Work for personal, educational, research, archival, testing, and
    other strictly non-commercial purposes;
(b) study, view, and modify the source code of the Work for strictly
    non-commercial purposes;
(c) copy and redistribute the unmodified Work for strictly non-commercial
    purposes, provided that this License, the copyright notice, the project
    name, and the repository link are retained;
(d) distribute Modified Versions strictly for non-commercial purposes only, if
    all conditions of Section 4 are satisfied.

3. Commercial Use Prohibited

Any Commercial Use of the Work or any Modified Version is strictly prohibited
without prior written permission from the copyright holder.

No person or entity may sell, license for a fee, monetize, commercially host,
commercially distribute, or otherwise commercially exploit the Work or any
Modified Version without explicit prior written authorization from the copyright
holder.

4. Copyleft Requirement for Modified Versions

If you Distribute a Modified Version, you must comply with all of the
following:

(a) you must provide the complete corresponding source code of the Modified
    Version at the time of Distribution;
(b) you must license the Modified Version under this same License, without
